MSID_H_ParticleEmblem: If unit's magic attack hits, inflicts Confusion\non foe. Trigger % = {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_PoisonBone: If unit's magic attack hits, inflicts Poison\non foe. Trigger % = {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_CarlaNeedle: Grants Atk{Variable=0} when making a follow-up.
MSID_H_MarsStone: Grants Atk{Variable=0}, Crit{Variable=1} when attacking\nwith a combat art.
MSID_H_PoisonJewel: If foe is Poisoned, unit takes {Variable=0}% damage\nwhen attacked.
MSID_H_HuntingJewel: If foe is Poisoned, multiplies unit's damage\nby {Variable=0} when attacking.
MSID_H_EventfulJewel: If foe is Confused, multiplies unit's damage\nby {Variable=0} when attacking.
MSID_H_FuraiJewel: Unit cannot suffer a follow-up during\ncombat. Trigger % = {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_LightningJewel: Multiplies damage by {Variable=1} when attacking\nwith a combat art. Trigger % = {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_FlameJewel: Grants Hit{Variable=1} when attacking with a\ncombat art. Trigger % = {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_StormJewel: When using a combat art, grants Avo{Variable=1}\nduring combat. Trigger % = {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_CriticalJewel: If unit makes a critical, unit recovers HP\nequal to a third of the damage they deal.
MSID_H_ChallengeJewel: If foe is equipped with the same weapon\ntype, grants Atk{Variable=0} to unit during combat.
MSID_H_PursuitJewel: Unit makes a follow-up regardless of AS\nduring combat. Trigger % = {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_CharmJewel: Inflicts Hit{Variable=0} on foe during combat.\nTrigger % = Cha ÷ 2.
MSID_H_SeverJewel: If unit attacks first, unit cannot suffer a\nfollow-up during combat. Trigger % = {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_MiracleJewel: Reduces damage to {Variable=1} when\nattacked. Trigger % = {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_DaintyJewel: If Cha ≥ foe's Cha+{Variable=0}, inflicts Hit{Variable=1}\non foe during combat.
MSID_H_SpiritJewel: Grants Avo{Variable=1} when attacked with a\nmagical attack. Trigger % = {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_MadnessJewel: If unit is Confused, grants Avo{Variable=0}.
MSID_H_SwordAmulet: If foe uses a sword, grants Hit/Avo{Variable=0} to\nunit during combat.
MSID_H_SpearAmulet: If foe uses a spear, grants Hit/Avo{Variable=0} to\nunit during combat.
MSID_H_AxeAmulet: If foe uses an axe, grants Hit/Avo{Variable=0} to\nunit during combat.
MSID_H_BowAmulet: If foe uses a bow, grants Hit/Avo{Variable=0} to\nunit during combat.
MSID_H_GauntletAmulet: If foe uses gauntlets, grants Hit/Avo{Variable=0} to\nunit during combat.
MSID_H_Warm: If unit's attack hits, inflicts Spd{Variable=0} on foe\nuntil unit's next phase.
MSID_H_Luna: Ignores foe's Res during combat.
MSID_H_R_Hit_Att: Grants Hit{Variable=0}, Atk{Variable=1}.
MSID_H_R_Avo_Sec: Grants Avo/Ddg{Variable=0}.
MSID_H_Regeia: Restores a little HP at start of unit's phase\nfor {Variable=0} {SingularPlural0=turn|turns}.
MSID_H_R_Hit: {PlusMinus0=Grants|Inflicts} Hit{Variable=0}.
MSID_H_R_CSHit: Grants Hit{Variable=0} when attacking with a\ncombat art.
