MSID_H_R_Def_Resx150: Multiplies Def/Res by {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_R_HolyWater: Grants Res{Variable=0}. (Decreases by {Variable=2} every\n{Variable=1} {SingularPlural1=turn|turns}.)
MSID_H_R_HellLordEffect: Unit takes half damage. Unaffected\nby Underworld Flame.
MSID_H_R_NoPursuit: Unit cannot suffer a follow-up.
MSID_H_R_Leading: Unit attacks first.
MSID_H_R_HitHalved: Halves Hit.
MSID_H_R_AvoHalved: Halves Avo.
MSID_H_R_ASHalved: Halves AS.
MSID_H_R_ProHalved: Halves Shld.
MSID_H_R_DefHalved: Halves Def.
MSID_H_R_HitHalved_00: Halves Hit.
MSID_H_R_Hit_AvoHalved: Halves Hit/Avo.
MSID_H_R_MagicDamageHalved: Unit takes half damage from magical\nattacks.
MSID_H_R_DamageHalved: Unit takes half damage from attacks.
MSID_H_R_Str_Mag_Invert: Str and Mag are swapped.
MSID_H_R_Def_Res_Invert: Def and Res are swapped.
MSID_H_R_NoReturn: Unit cannot counter.
MSID_H_R_NoCounter: Unit cannot be countered.
MSID_H_R_NoPoison: Unit cannot be Poisoned.
MSID_H_R_NoSealed: Unit cannot be Silenced.
MSID_H_R_HellEff: Attacks are effective vs. undead.
MSID_H_R_Continuous: Unit's follow-up occurs before foe's\ncounter.
MSID_H_R_InvalidEff: Neutralizes foe's effective bonuses.
MSID_H_R_InvalidCritical: Unit cannot suffer a critical attack.
MSID_H_R_Absorption: Unit recovers HP equal to half the damage\nthey deal.
MSID_H_R_Def0: Sets Def to 0.
MSID_H_R_BattleRecoveryS: After combat, restores a little HP to unit.
MSID_H_R_Res0: Sets Res to 0.
MSID_H_R_Pha_Hit: Grants Hit{Variable=0} to physical attacks.
MSID_H_R_Maa_Hit: Grants Hit{Variable=0} to magical attacks.
MSID_H_R_KillHeelM: After defeating a foe, restores some HP\nto unit.
MSID_H_R_Durability: Reduces weapon durability cost to 0.
MSID_H_R_Pha_DamageHalved: Unit takes half damage from\nphysical attacks.
MSID_H_R_Maa_DamageHalved: Unit takes half damage from\nmagical attacks.
MSID_H_R_Ect: Grants Prt{Variable=0}.
MSID_H_R_End: Grants Rsl{Variable=0}.
MSID_H_R_Tec_Spd: Grants Dex/Spd{Variable=0}.
MSID_H_R_Explanation: Grants Hit{Variable=1} during combat.\nTrigger % = {Variable=0}.
MSID_H_R_ReducedMoveCost: Applies {Variable=0} to movement cost \nfor terrain. (Cannot be reduced below 1.)
MSID_H_R_AutoRecovery: At start of unit's phase, restores a little HP\nto unit.
MSID_H_R_Antidote: Cannot be poisoned for {Variable=0} {SingularPlural0=turn|turns}.
MSID_H_R_RunThrough: Grants Mov{Variable=0} for {Variable=1} {SingularPlural1=turn|turns}.
MSID_H_R_FirstAidFormation: Extends range of Patch Up to\n{Variable=0} {SingularPlural0=space|spaces}.
